@startuml
title CampusFind System - Context Data Flow Diagram (Level 0)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #1F4E79
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5

rectangle "Campus User\n(Student / Faculty / Staff)" as User #D9E1F2
rectangle "Campus Administrator\n/ Reviewer" as Admin #FCE4D6
circle "0.0\nCampusFind System" as System #BDD7EE

User -down-> System : [DF1] Lost / Found Item Details\n[DF2] Ownership Claim & Secret Clue\n[DF3] Search & Filter Criteria
System -up-> User : [DF4] Public Item Listings (Clues Hidden)\n[DF5] Submission Receipts & Status Updates

Admin -down-> System : [DF6] Review Decisions (Accept / Reject)\n[DF7] Administrative Remarks
System -up-> Admin : [DF8] Pending Claims Queue\n[DF9] Private Clue vs Claim Proof Comparison

@enduml
